<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1681_6141.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Unser <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">frundlichen</unclear> willigen dienst, und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gruoß</unclear>, und wz wir ehr liebs
<lb n="2"/>und guots <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vermoegendt</unclear>, zuovor <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fromme</unclear>, fürsichtig, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ehrsamen</unclear> und wyß
<lb n="3"/>insonders guote <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">frunden</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gethreuwen</unclear> lieben Eyd und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">pundtgnossen</unclear>.
<lb n="4"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wyr</unclear> habendt <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">euwer</unclear> an <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gethonen</unclear> schryben <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">empfangen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uß</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">dem</unclear>-
<lb n="5"/>bey <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verstanden</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wie</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">euwer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">iunwohner</unclear> <persName resp="#ner">Hanß Halder</persName> euch berichtet
<lb n="6"/>habe, wie er zuo <placeName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Thusis</unclear></placeName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wegen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">einer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erbschafft</unclear> im rechten erwachsen sige,
<lb n="7"/>doselbst <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vermeint</unclear> zuo <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">einer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">endtlichen</unclear> urthel gelanget. Doch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">letstlichen</unclear>
<lb n="8"/>sige an <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">andre</unclear> orthen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gezogen</unclear> und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">geappellieret</unclear> worden, vnd syni
<lb n="9"/>widerpart. Diewyl auch die <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gsandten</unclear> deß <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">obren</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">grawen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">pundts</unclear>
<lb n="10"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">den</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">appellatzgcht</unclear> zuo Trunß zusamenn kommendt, ein intercession
<lb n="11"/>an dieselbige <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">begert</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">domit</unclear> er doch <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ein</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mahl</unclear> zuo <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">einem</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ußtrag</unclear>
<lb n="12"/>seiner sach <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">kommen</unclear> moege. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Derohalben</unclear> wir euch u. g. l. E. und
<lb n="13"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">pundtgnossen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ein</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">warhafftig</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bricht</unclear> zuogeben unbeschwert sin
<lb n="14"/>wellendt.
<lb n="15"/>Wüssendt derhalben dz diser armer man Hanß Halder <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">pretendirt</unclear>
<lb n="16"/>ein <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erb</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">über</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">welche</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">pretension</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erstlich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuo</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Thusis</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ein</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">urthel</unclear> ergangen,
<lb n="17"/>do er Hanß Halder der erbschafft excludiert. Noch dem hatt er
<lb n="18"/>sich beschwert, und dz gricht doselbst für partyisch allegiert, und
<lb n="19"/>ein gmeinen unpartyisch gricht begert, welches ihme zuo
<lb n="20"/><placeName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ratzunß</unclear></placeName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vergunt</unclear> worden; <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">lase</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">es</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">aber</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">by</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">deme</unclear> nit beruwen wellen,
<lb n="21"/>abermaalen ein algemeinen Recht deß gantzen pundts uber beschwerdten
<lb n="22"/>rechtshandel gsetzt, doselbst clag, andtwurt, kundtschafften
<lb n="23"/>und alles ordenlichen ghoert und wol erdauret, auch ein endt urthel
<lb n="24"/>inapellabilem gefelt, mit welcher urthel er des erb excludiert.
<lb n="25"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Pittenndt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">derhalben</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">e</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">w</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">l</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">pundtgnossen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sy</unclear> wellendt
<lb n="26"/>ihn Hanß Halder von seinen fantasien abschaffen, dz er <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ruewigklich</unclear>
<lb n="27"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">doheim</unclear> ohne wyteren <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ersuochnung</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verblihen</unclear> solle. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Dan</unclear> so die billig-
<lb n="28"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">keidt</unclear> und gerechtigkeit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wyters</unclear> mit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sich</unclear> gebracht hette, hettendt wir
<lb n="29"/>nit ermanglet <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ihm</unclear> zuo <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dem</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">seinig</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuohelffen</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Pittendt</unclear> also <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ihr</unclear>
<lb n="30"/>wellendt <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">disen</unclear> unsern <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bricht</unclear> in aller Eydt und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">pundtgnossisch</unclear>
<lb n="31"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wolmeinung</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">verston</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Hiemit</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gottes</unclear> schutz und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schirm</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">beudeh</unclear>-
<lb n="32"/>ende. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Geben</unclear> zuo <origPlace resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Trunß</unclear></origPlace> <origDate when="1610-05-13" resp="#ner">den 13. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Meyen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">im</unclear> 1610</origDate>
<lb n="33"/>E. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">W</unclear>. L. E. und P.
<lb n="34"/>Landtrichter und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Rhatt</unclear>
<lb n="35"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">auch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gmeine</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gsandten</unclear> zuo <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Trunß</unclear>
<lb n="36"/>by ein <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">andren</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">versampt</unclear>.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1681_6142.jpg" n="2"/>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1681_6143.jpg" n="3"/>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1681_6144.jpg" n="4"/>
<lb n="37"/>Den frommen, fuersichtig, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ehrsamen</unclear>, und
<lb n="38"/>weisen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hr</unclear>. <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-148" cert="medium" role="recipient" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Burgermeister</unclear> und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Rhat</unclear>
<lb n="39"/>der Statt Sant Gallen</orgName>, unsern <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guoten</unclear>
<lb n="40"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fruenden</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gethruewen</unclear> lieben <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eid</unclear>- und
<lb n="41"/>pundtsgnossen.
<lb n="42"/><placeName ref="stadtasg-places-38" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Sant Gallen</placeName>.
</p>
